{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T16:56:24+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-30T16:56:24+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"S.T. Dupont S.A.","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Luxury Goods","country":"France","city":"Paris","website":"https://www.st-dupont.com","employees":249,"summary":"S.T. Dupont S.A. manufactures and distributes luxury products in France, the rest of Europe, and Asia. The company offers lighters; writing instruments, which include pens; smoking accessories comprising cigar and cigarette cases, lighter cases, cigar cutters, ashtrays, and humidors; accessories; men's leather goods consisting of business, backpacks, travel bags, crossbody, camera bags, pouches, tote bags, card holders, and wallets; women's leather goods, including handbags, shoulder bags, cross body, and shopping bags; accessories, such as cufflinks, belts, key holders, money clips, tie clips, lighter necklaces, and market necklaces; ready-to-wear clothing; and notebooks, pen cases, refills, and other office accessories. It also provides personalization, digital passport, e-commerce, and after-sales services. The company sells its products through its stores, off-trade and shop retail stores, franchised locations, and online, as well as through agents and distributors. It exports its products. The company was founded in 1872 and is headquartered in Paris, France. S.T. Dupont S.A. operates a subsidiary of D&D International B.V.","exchange":"Paris","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"S.T. Dupont S.A. fabrique et distribue des produits de luxe en France, dans le reste de l’Europe et en Asie. La société propose des briquets; des instruments d'écriture, qui comprennent des stylos; des accessoires pour fumer comprenant des cigares et des cigarettes, des boîtiers plus légers, des coupe-cigares, des cendriers et des humidificateurs; des accessoires; des artic